---
title: Overnight Oats
description: Rolled oats soaked in milk and yoghurt overnight, berries on top.
image: "[[Attachments/Recipes/overnight-oats.svg]]"
servings: 2
course: breakfast
prep time: 5 min
tags: [breakfast, quick, vegetarian]
---
Stir @rolled oats{100%g} into @milk{250%ml} with @yoghurt{100%g} and @honey{1%tbsp} in a #jar{}.

Leave in the fridge for ~{8%hours}. Top with @blueberries{80%g}.
